   839	PROVED-HERE   general H-adic raw formula and Euclidean carry recursion.
   840	PROVED-HERE   charged (2,3) identity is false; corrected identity verified.
   841	PROVED-HERE   normalized Moh C!=0 loci are empty (scoped as stated).
   842	PROVED-HERE   uniform q=1 family refutes the global gamma-degree clause.
