   846	
   847	No exit price is asserted, so no `charge_basis` line is declared.  No
   848	representative is promoted to a full actual exit, no lower floor is called
   849	attainment, and no pole identity is used.  The variable map and coefficient
   850	rings are declared in §1.2.  Raw remainders are taken only after monic
   851	Euclidean normalization, with zero handled explicitly.  The literal repeated
   852	(c_5) and the independent-(c_6) editorial reading are not conflated.
   853	Most importantly, §6.3 applies the source-mandated denominator shedding and
