+
+**PROVED-HERE / exact coefficient certificate.**  The normalized equation
+\(J(f,g)=Cx\) gives 36 coefficients.  On \(C\ne0\), its \(x^1y^0\)
+coefficient gives
+
+\[
+C=\frac4{81}c_3c_9(c_3^2-9c_9),
