+
+No exit price is asserted, so no `charge_basis` line is needed.  There is no
+representative/full-exit, floor/attainment, or pole/interior promotion.
+Section 1.2 types the ring map; §3 carries raw remainders and handles zero.
+The two \(c_5/c_6\) readings stay separate, and §6.3 sheds rather than uses a
+raw terminal exponent.

